.ad l
.SH NAME
parking\-report \- turn a JSON list of cars into Hebrew
parking\-violation report texts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B parking\-report
[\fB\-h\fR]
[\fB\-\-intake\fR\ \fIDIR\fR]
[\fB\-\-drive\-folder\fR\ \fIID\fR]
[\fB\-\-city\fR\ \fICITY\fR]
[\fB\-\-name\fR\ \fINAME\fR]
[\fB\-\-no\-photo\fR]
[\fB\-\-municipality\fR\ \fINAME_OR_FILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-reporter\fR\ \fIFILE\fR]
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
[\fIinput\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turn a JSON list of cars into Hebrew parking\-violation report texts.
.PP
Give exactly one of a cars JSON file (input) or \-\-intake DIR.
\-\-drive\-folder requires \-\-intake; \-\-reporter and \-\-json require
\-\-municipality.
.PP
JSON output: only with \-\-municipality.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show this help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-intake\fR \fIDIR\fR
Read report folders (report.json + photo each) from DIR instead of a
cars file; see docs/INTAKE.md. Read\-only: only records with status
\&'ready' are used.
.TP
\fB\-\-drive\-folder\fR \fIID\fR
With \-\-intake, first copy that Google Drive folder into DIR
(read\-only; needs a read\-only access token in PARKING_DRIVE_TOKEN)
.TP
\fB\-\-city\fR \fICITY\fR
City appended to the street.
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fINAME\fR
Reporter name for the sign\-off.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-photo\fR
Omit the photo line.
.TP
\fB\-\-municipality\fR \fINAME_OR_FILE\fR
Print copy\-paste form field values for a municipality (bundled name
such as 'jerusalem', or a config .json path)
.TP
\fB\-\-reporter\fR \fIFILE\fR
JSON file with reporter details for the form (keep it outside the
repo)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
With \-\-municipality, print JSON instead of text.
.SS Arguments
.TP
\fIinput\fR
JSON file with a list of cars.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBPARKING_DRIVE_TOKEN\fR
Read\-only Google Drive access token, used only with \-\-drive\-folder.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Report text (or \-\-json submissions) on stdout; also \-\-help text.
.TP
.B 1
Input/config error, \fBerror: ...\fR on stderr.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error (argparse or a flag\-combination rule), usage text on
stderr.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR p106\-stats (1),
.BR parking\-report\-106 (1),
